# DATABASE WORKFLOW [CRITICAL]

## Rule DB.0a: Ask environment first

Before any PostgreSQL MCP call, the user must name an environment that exists in `.cursor/project-config.json` → `environments[]`. If missing, ask and STOP. Do not infer from tickets or habit.

Map environment `mcpServerName` (e.g. `PostgreSQLStaging`) to the matching MCP server.

## Rule DB.1: Read-only by default

Prefer SELECT. Writes require explicit user approval (hook may ask).

## Rule DB.2: Cite evidence

When DB backs a claim, include schema/object and summarized query result (no secrets).
